				(text "DRIVE Connector:\n\n 1: B17 DID0\n 2: GND\n 3: A17 DID1\n 4: GND\n 5: B18 DID2\n 6: GND\n 7: A18 DID3\n 8: GND\n 9: B19 DID4\n10: GND\n11: A19 DID5\n12: GND\n13: B20 DID6\n14: GND\n15: A20 DID7\n16: GND\n17: E17 ~{DIDSTR}\n18: GND\n19: D17 ~{DIHSTR}\n20: GND\n21: C17 DIDIR\n22: E18 ~{DIRST}\n23: D18 DICOVER\n24: C18 DIBRK\n25: E19 ~{DIERR}\n26: C20 AISCLK\n27: D20 AISD\n28: C19 AISLR\n29: N/A EJECT     switch from Hollywood C16 / MX drives this pin with U22,\nRequires MX chip pin 20\n\n30: N/A DISCIN        10K pullup to 3.3V, for disc detection, sends\nhigh signal with a nand gate to pin 18 of MX\n\n31: D19 NOSPINUP\n32: 3.3V\n"
